+# Changelog
+
+All notable changes to this project are documented here. The format follows
+[Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/), and versions follow
+[Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
+
+This repository is generated. Each rdgen update replaces it with upstream rdgen plus the patch series of
+[rustdesk-cortendesk-pve](https://github.com/rob-paprocki/rustdesk-cortendesk-pve), so its changes, versions and
+upgrade notes are in
+[that project's changelog](https://github.com/rob-paprocki/rustdesk-cortendesk-pve/blob/stable/CHANGELOG.md).
+
+## [Unreleased]
+
+**Upgrading:** nothing to do. The daily rdgen update keeps this repository current.
