+This repository is rdgen, a RustDesk client generator, with the patch series of
+rustdesk-cortendesk-pve (https://github.com/rob-paprocki/rustdesk-cortendesk-pve)
+applied.
+
+Upstream: https://github.com/bryangerlach/rdgen (GPL-3.0), by Bryan Gerlach
+and contributors.
+
+rdgen builds clients of RustDesk (https://github.com/rustdesk/rustdesk), a
+separate project by its own authors under AGPL-3.0. RustDesk is not included
+here; the build workflows fetch it at build time.
+
+The patched rdgen stays under the GNU General Public License v3.0. See LICENSE.
